# Navigating the Unfriendly Seas' 292 (an Event) at Nashmau's Leleroon (no script; default 264), against the hidden
# quest Crafted Corsair Artifact (Lua; open once Against All Odds is accepted): its first-visit 282 is a Progress. A
# level 50 Corsair with Navigating accepted at Prog 1 and Against All Odds accepted (GMs: out of play order), Crafted
# Corsair Artifact at its Prog 0: each talk: 282 (the Progress beats the Event 292); a Progress 292 would tie with it
# and rotate. 282 finished on option 0: nothing (no letter), so the state stays.
lists Nashmau/Leleroon/onTrigger
char zone=Nashmau pos=-13.187,0,25.114 job=COR lvl=50
quest AhtUrhgan.LuckOfTheDraw completed
quest AhtUrhgan.EquippedForAllOccasions completed
quest AhtUrhgan.NavigatingTheUnfriendlySeas accepted
charvar Quest[6][25]Prog 1
quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds accepted
login
trigger Leleroon                        # 292 (Event) and Crafted Corsair Artifact's 282 (Progress): 282
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Leleroon                        # 282 again
finish option=0
trigger Leleroon                        # 282 again
finish option=0
